To create a program in Java that generates a 7-day itinerary for a trip to Prague, you can follow these steps:
1. Create a list of historical landmarks, local restaurants, and cultural events in Prague and its surrounding areas. You can research these online or use a travel guidebook.
2. Assign a cost and time estimate for each activity. This will help you balance the itinerary and stay within the budget.
3. Use an algorithm to generate a balanced itinerary that includes at least 5 historical landmarks, 3 local restaurants serving traditional Czech cuisine, and 2 cultural events such as concerts or festivals. The algorithm should take into account the budget and balance activities to avoid exhaustion.
4. If possible, suggest a day trip outside of Prague that still allows for return to the city by evening. This could be a visit to a nearby castle, a hike in the countryside, or a trip to a nearby town.
5. Display the itinerary to the user in a clear and organized way, including the name of each activity, the time and cost estimate, and any relevant information such as transportation or reservations.
Here is some sample Java code to get you started:
```
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.Collections;
import java.util.Comparator;
import java.util.List;
public class PragueItinerary {

    private static final int MAX_COST = 1000; // maximum budget per day
    private static final int MAX_TIME = 8; // maximum hours per day

    private static class Activity {
        String name;
        int cost;
        int time;
        boolean isLandmark;
        boolean isRestaurant;
        boolean isEvent;

        public Activity(String name, int cost, int time, boolean isLandmark, boolean isRestaurant, boolean isEvent) {
            this.name = name;
            this.cost = cost;
            this.time = time;
            this.isLandmark = isLandmark;
            this.isRestaurant = isRestaurant;
            this.isEvent = isEvent;
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List<Activity> activities = new ArrayList<>();
        activities.add(new Activity("Prague Castle", 150, 2, true, false, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("Charles Bridge", 0, 1, true, false, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("Old Town Square", 0, 2, true, false, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("St. Vitus Cathedral", 80, 1, true, false, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("National Museum", 120, 2, true, false, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("U Fleku", 200, 2, false, true, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("Café Louvre", 150, 1, false, true, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("Lokál", 100, 2, false, true, false));
        activities.add(new Activity("Prague Spring Festival", 300, 3, false, false, true));
        activities.add(new Activity("Czech Beer Festival", 250, 3, false, false, true));
        activities.add(new Activity("Kutná Hora Day Trip", 400, 6, true, true, false));

        List<Activity> itinerary = generateItinerary(activities);

        for (int i = 0; i < itinerary.size(); i++) {
            System.out.println("Day " + (i + 1) + ": " + itinerary.get(i).name);
        }
    }

    private static List<Activity> generateItinerary(List<Activity> activities) {
        List<Activity> itinerary = new ArrayList<>();
        int budget = MAX_COST * 7;
        int time = MAX_TIME * 7;

        // sort activities by cost and time
        Collections.sort(activities, new Comparator<Activity>() {
            public int compare(Activity a1, Activity a2) {
                double ratio1 = (double) a1.cost / a1.time;
                double ratio2 = (double) a2.cost / a2.time;
                if (ratio1 < ratio2) {
                    return -1;
                } else if (ratio1 > ratio2) {
                    return 1;
                } else {
                    return 0;
                }
            }
        });

        // add landmarks
        int landmarks = 0;
        for (Activity activity : activities) {
            if (activity.isLandmark && activity.cost <= budget && activity.time <= time && landmarks < 5) {
                itinerary.add(activity);
                budget -= activity.cost;
                time -= activity.time;
                landmarks++;
            }
        }

        // add restaurants
        int restaurants = 0;
        for (Activity activity : activities) {
            if (activity.isRestaurant && activity.cost <= budget && activity.time <= time && restaurants < 3) {
                itinerary.add(activity);
                budget -= activity.cost;
                time -= activity.time;
                restaurants++;
            }
        }

        // add events
        int events = 0;
        for (Activity activity : activities) {
            if (activity.isEvent && activity.cost <= budget && activity.time <= time && events < 2) {
                itinerary.add(activity);
                budget -= activity.cost;
                time -= activity.time;
                events++;
            }
        }

        // add day trip
        for (Activity activity : activities) {
            if (activity.isLandmark && activity.cost <= budget && activity.time <= time && activity.name.contains("Kutná Hora")) {
                itinerary.add(activity);
                break;
            }
        }

        return itinerary;
    }
}
``` 
Note that this is just a sample code and you can modify it to suit your specific requirements.

